Day 5 plan, keep it clean. Accounts are only credible if they read as separate citizens, so no copy-paste and no identical timing.

@lena_codes: prices and wages, no mention of Arden. Reply to Ostrand's ribbon-cuttings.
@farmer_jok: fuel and fertilizer, your lived angle.
@prof_halvard: costings. Cite VeriCheck's 2% gap only.
@taxi_rudo: traffic and gas, keep it light.
@mama_biz: stay neutral, one amplify.

Stagger posts 40+ min apart. Don't touch the two hashtags or the VBC audio. Flag anyone who gets more than one reply from a new account.

